## EveryState
<div class="yh-mixband" data-form="tall" data-part="root">
  <div key=drums class="yh-mixband__strip" data-hue="1" data-part="strip" data-track="drums">
    <button aria-label="select Drums" class="yh-mixband__head" data-part="head" type="button" @click=select:drums>
